Week 2 Assignment: Simple Bill Calculator
Description
Ask the user for the price of one item and the quantity they want (use input()).
Remember input() returns a string — convert the values with float() / int().
Calculate the total.
Print a friendly summary using an f-string, e.g. "3 items at 50.00 each = 150.00".
Build an interactive program that takes user input, does a calculation, and shows a neat result using an f-string.



Submission Criteria
Create a new github repository for python week 1 assignment
Upload the code for the assignment to github
Submit the github repository link to us